&lt;p&gt;&lt;br &sol;&gt;The following table lists addition codes which describe components or features that can be physically incorporated in the specified custom fabricated base orthosis but are considered not reasonable and necessary. These addition codes, if they are billed with the related base code, will be denied as not reasonable and necessary.&lt;&sol;p&gt;
